WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
01 / A separate, safe demonstration
The working version and sensitive operational data remain in the owner’s private environment.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
02 / Review the partner pipeline
See readiness, upcoming experiences, current stages, and the next preparation action.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
03 / Prepare around the partner
Start with identity, context, a specific workflow, maturity, and the proposed experience.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
04 / Adjust details and numbers
Change context, event details, targets, and counts. Demo edits stay in the current browser tab.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
05 / Plan the customer implementation
Assign a dedicated solutions architect. Track dated milestones, owners, dependencies, and progress.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
06 / Coordinate the delivery team
Sales, Marketing, Legal, Solutions Architecture, Engineering, and Product. All names are fictional.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
07 / Measure enablement and adoption
Update activated seats, training delivered, and people trained. Export the workspace to keep changes.
